    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="0691" n="599" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg599"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 012.2/30c</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the British Ambassador
                        on Special Mission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Reading</hi>)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d516-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I transmit herewith, at the request
                    of the Secretary of War, a memorandum prepared by him with reference to the
                    representative capacity in which Mr. Edward R. Stettinius, Second Assistant
                    Secretary of War, is proceeding to Europe to attend the meetings of the
                    Inter-Allied Munitions Council during his stay abroad.</p>
                <p>The Secretary of War is particularly anxious to have it clearly understood by the
                    British Government that the presence of Mr. Stettinius in Europe and at the
                    meetings of the Munitions Council shall not be misunderstood, and that the
                    limitations upon his representative capacity are definite, and as stated in this
                    memorandum.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frank L. Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d516-a1.xml" xpointer="d516-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d516-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d516-f1-content">
                <p>The same, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, on the same date, to the
                    French and Italian Ambassadors.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
